@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Baseline: 200, relationships null
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1001

### Single expansion: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1001?expand=customer

### Items without products: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1001?expand=items

### Nested expansion: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1001?expand=customer,items.product&relatedLimit=3

### Bounded preview: 200, hasMore true
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1001?expand=items.product&relatedLimit=1

### Empty collection: 200, data []
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1002?expand=items

### Unsupported relationship: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1001?expand=payments

### Excess depth: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1001?expand=items.product.supplier

### Excess limit: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1001?expand=items&relatedLimit=51

### Missing order: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/9999

### Normalized selections: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1001?expand=%20CUSTOMER%20,items.product,customer
